## Branches

- Task branches are `<human-owner>/<lowercase-task-slug>`, for example `{{ first_prefix }}/room-renumber`. Each part uses lowercase letters, digits, and single hyphens.
- The prefix names the accountable human. AI or vendor prefixes are rejected. The name is self-declared; it is not proof of identity.
- `main` and `stable` are integration branches. All changes, including documentation, reach them through pull requests.

